      "title": "8:00 AM — Day Two: The Reset",
      "chapter": "Chapter 8",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "Morning breaks. Bonnie survived the night. She is showered, dressed, and her record is intact. The slate is clean."
